---
import MarketingLayout from '@/layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config';

const { legal, contact } = siteConfig;
const fullAddress = [
  contact.address.street,
  contact.address.city,
  contact.address.state,
  contact.address.country,
]
  .filter(Boolean)
  .join(', ');
---

<MarketingLayout
  title={`Disclaimer - ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description={`Disclaimer for ${siteConfig.name}. Understand the limitations of our information, our estimates, and our tools.`}
>
  <section class="py-section">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text">Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">Last updated: {legal.lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
        <p>
          Please read this Disclaimer carefully before relying on any information provided by
          {siteConfig.name}. By using this website, you acknowledge and agree to the limitations set out
          below.
        </p>

        <h2>Information Platform, Not an Advisor or Dealer</h2>
        <p>
          {siteConfig.name} is an independent information and research platform. We are <strong>not</strong> a vehicle
          dealer, importer, broker, customs agent, financial advisor, or legal professional. We do not sell
          vehicles, and we do not provide legal, tax, customs, financial, or investment advice. Any
          decision you make based on information from this website is made at your own risk.
        </p>

        <h2>Educational and Research Nature</h2>
        <p>
          Our content — model pages, landed-cost breakdowns, technology definitions, market comparisons,
          and guides — is published for educational and market-intelligence purposes. It is general in
          nature and is not tailored to your specific circumstances, vehicle configuration, destination
          country, or commercial position. You should not treat it as a substitute for due diligence on a
          specific vehicle, supplier, or transaction.
        </p>

        <h2>Not Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing on this website constitutes legal, tax, customs, financial, investment, or other
          professional advice. Importing a vehicle involves country-specific legal, fiscal, and technical
          requirements. Before acting, you should obtain advice from qualified professionals — including
          a licensed customs broker, a tax advisor, and a legal advisor familiar with your destination
          jurisdiction.
        </p>

        <h2>Landed-Cost Estimates Are Approximate, Not Quotes</h2>
        <p>
          The landed-cost calculator and all cost figures on this website are <strong>approximate,
          illustrative estimates</strong> intended to help you understand the potential components of an
          import transaction. They are <strong>reference estimates, not quotes, offers, or predictions</strong>.
          They are based on information available at the time of writing and on assumptions that may not
          apply to your specific situation.
        </p>
        <p>Actual costs can differ materially due to factors including, but not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Changes in import duties, tariffs, countervailing duties, and taxes</li>
          <li>Currency exchange-rate fluctuations</li>
          <li>Your exact vehicle configuration, trim, and options</li>
          <li>Freight, insurance, port, and handling charges at the time of shipment</li>
          <li>Customs classifications and rulings applicable to your transaction</li>
          <li>Compliance and certification requirements in your destination country</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You must verify all duties, taxes, and costs with the relevant customs authority, a licensed
          customs broker, or another qualified professional before committing to any purchase or import.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy and Currency of Information</h2>
        <p>
          We endeavor to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date. However, tariffs,
          regulations, prices, and vehicle specifications change frequently, and we make no representation
          or warranty as to the accuracy, completeness, currency, or reliability of any content.
          Information may become outdated without notice. Each data-bearing page carries a verification
          date or source note so you can judge its freshness; see our{' '}
          <a href="/compliance/">Data Compliance</a> policy for how we grade and date sources.
        </p>

        <h2>Vehicle Data and Specifications</h2>
        <p>
          Vehicle specifications, prices, range figures, and model data on this website are compiled from
          public sources and manufacturer publications. We do not operate, test, or inspect any vehicle,
          and we do not verify manufacturer or supplier claims. Model data may reflect the China-market
          specification rather than export variants, may differ from the vehicle you actually receive,
          and may change at any time. Always confirm specifications, equipment, and price with the
          supplier or manufacturer before ordering.
        </p>

        <h2>Compliance and Certification Information</h2>
        <p>
          Guidance on this website about vehicle approval, homologation, certification, and conformity —
          including our <a href="/docs/compliance-requirements/">compliance requirements</a> overview and
          market import guides — is general planning information, not legal advice and not a guarantee
          that any specific vehicle will pass any specific approval process. Approval routes,
          thresholds, standards, and national procedures change, and each approval is decided by the
          relevant authority for the specific vehicle and VIN. Confirm the current requirements with the
          destination authority or an accredited technical service before ordering a vehicle.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Data and Trademarks</h2>
        <p>
          Vehicle names, brand names, logos, specifications, and other third-party data on this website
          belong to their respective owners and are provided for identification and reference purposes
          only. Inclusion does not imply affiliation with, endorsement by, or sponsorship by any
          manufacturer, exporter, or other entity.
        </p>        <p>
          The website does not review, vet, or certify any vehicle supplier, dealer, or importer. Any
          engagement you enter into with a third party is solely between you and that third party, and
          we are not a party to it.
        </p>

        <h2>Reliance on Tools and Data Endpoints</h2>
        <p>
          Our interactive tools — the landed-cost calculator and the comparison tool — and our
          machine-readable <code>/data/</code> endpoints are provided for reference and research only. A
          result produced by a tool, or a value read from a dataset, carries the same limitations as the
          figures on the pages they come from: it is an estimate or a compiled figure, not a quote, an
          offer, or a commitment. You are responsible for verifying any figure before relying on it for
          a transaction. See our <a href="/compliance/">Data Compliance</a> policy for the license and
          provenance of the machine-readable data.
        </p>

        <h2>No Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, {siteConfig.name}, its operator, and their respective
          officers, directors, employees, and agents shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising
          from your use of, or reliance on, the information provided on this website — whether direct,
          indirect, incidental, consequential, or otherwise. This includes reliance on estimates produced
          by our calculator or comparison tools. Nothing in this Disclaimer excludes liability that cannot
          be excluded under applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This website may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content,
          accuracy, or practices of any third-party website, and the inclusion of a link does not imply
          endorsement. Your use of a linked site is subject to that site's own terms and policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Forward-Looking and Time-Sensitive Information</h2>
        <p>
          Some content describes anticipated changes — proposed tariff adjustments, planned regulations, or
          expected model launches. Such statements reflect the information available when they were
          written and are inherently uncertain; actual outcomes may differ materially. You should not
          treat any forward-looking statement on this website as a prediction of future events or a basis
          for financial planning. Figures are only as current as their stated verification date, and a
          tariff or price that was accurate when written may be stale when you read it.
        </p>

        <h2>No Investment, Financial, or Trading Advice</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing on this website is intended as investment, financial, or trading advice, and nothing
          here should be read as a recommendation to buy, import, hold, or sell any vehicle or financial
          interest. Market intelligence about Chinese EV import economics is provided for education and
          research, not as a solicitation to enter any transaction. Any import decision, and its financial
          consequences, are yours alone.
        </p>

        <h2>Professional Advice Recommended</h2>
        <p>
          Before making any purchasing, import, financial, or legal decision, we strongly recommend that
          you consult with qualified professionals such as a licensed customs broker, a tax advisor, and a
          legal advisor familiar with the laws of your destination jurisdiction.
        </p>

        <h2>Currency and Exchange Rates</h2>
        <p>
          Where prices are shown in a single currency (ordinarily US dollars), the conversion from the
          manufacturer's domestic currency reflects the exchange rate in effect at the time of writing.
          Exchange rates move continuously, and the landed cost in your own currency will depend on the
          rate your bank or payment provider applies at the time of settlement, plus any transfer or
          currency-conversion fees. Treat any currency figure here as an approximation, and confirm the
          current rate and the applicable fees before budgeting.
        </p>

        <h2>No Warranty of Availability or Continuity</h2>
        <p>
          We do not warrant that this website or any tool, dataset, or page will be available at all times,
          uninterrupted, or free of errors or omissions. We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of
          the website — including the calculator, the comparison tool, or the <code>/data/</code> endpoints
          — at any time without notice. A snapshot of data you download today may not match what is
          published tomorrow, because tariffs, specifications, and prices change and because we revise our
          own figures.
        </p>

        <h2>Scope of This Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          This Disclaimer applies to all pages, tools, datasets, and content published at
          electricvehiclehub.net, and to any content we publish on third-party platforms that links back
          to this page. It should be read together with our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>,
          which set out the governing law, and our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, which describes
          what we do and do not collect. If any part of this Disclaimer is found unenforceable, the
          remainder continues in effect.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Disclaimer, please contact us at:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${legal.legalEmail}`}>{legal.legalEmail}</a></li>
          <li>Address: {fullAddress}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
